# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: AddrSpace.
Package: AddrSpace
Section: System
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32
Depends: SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport
Components: Apps.Utilities.!AddrSpace (Movable LookAt)
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-addrspace
Description: Shows what is using RISC OS's logical address space
 Lists every dynamic area with its owner, size and reserved space,
 highlights changes, measures the free space, and finds the cause of
 "Unable to allocate logical address space".
Build-Map: !AddrSpace -> Apps/Utilities/!AddrSpace
Build-Notice: AddrSpace, packaged for PackMan from the release zip on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-addrspace/releases
 .
 AddrSpace is under the GNU GPL version 2 or later, which follows.
